{"topic":"Lunch at School","scenarios":[{"scenario":"What is in your lunch box?","context":"Two friends open their lunch boxes.","speakerA":[{"en":"What's in your lunch box?","level":"A1"},{"en":"I have rice and chicken.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Yes, I do. It's my favorite.","level":"A1"}],"speakerB":[{"en":"I have a sandwich and an apple.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Yummy! Do you like it?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Me too. Let's eat!","level":"A1"}]},{"scenario":"Can I have some water?","context":"A child is thirsty.","speakerA":[{"en":"Excuse me. Can I have some water?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Thank you.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Yes, I am very thirsty.","level":"A1"}],"speakerB":[{"en":"Yes. Here is your cup.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Are you thirsty?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Drink slowly, please.","level":"A1"}]},{"scenario":"I don't like carrots","context":"A child does not want a vegetable.","speakerA":[{"en":"I don't like carrots.","level":"A1"},{"en":"No, thank you.","level":"A1"},{"en":"OK. One small carrot.","level":"A1"}],"speakerB":[{"en":"Try one small carrot.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Carrots are good for you.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Well done! Is it good?","level":"A1"}]},{"scenario":"Let's share","context":"Two friends share food.","speakerA":[{"en":"I have two cookies.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Yes, you can. Here you are.","level":"A1"},{"en":"Yes, please.","level":"A1"}],"speakerB":[{"en":"Can I have one?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Thank you! I have grapes. Do you want some?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Here. Let's share.","level":"A1"}]},{"scenario":"Wash your hands","context":"The teacher says it is lunch time.","speakerA":[{"en":"Time for lunch, children!","level":"A1"},{"en":"First, wash your hands.","level":"A1"},{"en":"It's next to the sink.","level":"A1"}],"speakerB":[{"en":"Can we eat now?","level":"A1"},{"en":"OK. Where is the soap?","level":"A1"},{"en":"Thank you, teacher.","level":"A1"}]}]}